	(gr_text "FAB DRAWING NOTES (HW-H2-01)\nReview copy - NOT released for fabrication (H4 = human approval)\n1. Outline 100.05 x 100.05 mm, Edge.Cuts. 2 Cu layers, 1.6 mm (upstream).\n2. H1-H3: 3.2 mm NPTH for M3, 3.5 mm from edges, no net,\n   no copper/track/via within 3.8 mm radius (F.Cu + B.Cu).\n3. No top-right hole: J3 terminal + VDD edge track occupy it.\n4. U5 tabs: 2 x 4.1 mm NPTH. All other holes plated.\n5. Material, Cu weight, finish, mask/silk colour: ASSUMPTIONS,\n   see hardware/prototype-v1/FABRICATION_NOTES.md."
